<title>USA: IPO FILING - Jaymark Inc.</title>
<headline>IPO FILING - Jaymark Inc.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name		     Jaymark Inc</p>
<p>Stock symbol			JMRK.O</p>
<p>Estimated price range	   $12-$14/shr</p>
<p>Total shares to be offered *  1.3 million</p>
<p>Shrs offered by company *    1.3 million</p>
<p>Shrs outstanding after ipo *  1,648,309</p>
<p>Lead Underwriter	 Brean Murray &amp; Co Inc</p>
<p>Underwriters over-allotment  195,000 shrs</p>
<p>* note: shares offered are Class A.</p>
<p>Business: Jaymark, based in San Diego, Calif., provides advanced technology products and services to the Department of Defense and other government agencies, and commercializes selected governnment-funded technologies following a discipline evaluation of market size and profitability. Use of Proceeds: For general corporate purposes, including product development, working capital and potential acquisitions, for repayment of indebtedness outstanding under the company's bank line of credit, and to finance the company's repurchase, subject to certain conditions, of 120,000 common shares.</p>
<p>Financial Data in 000s year ended Jan 31:</p>
<p>				   1996		 1995</p>
<p>   - Revenue		 $52,928	    $57,656</p>
<p>   - Net Income		 $336		 $322</p>
